{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV19samplingDropReportsScSyAA08SamplingD6ReportVGvp","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L234","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"title":"samplingDropReports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","text":"SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aren’t sampled again."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the tracker has finished. A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s is empty."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Sampler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},{"type":"text","text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen."}],"title":"samplingDropReports","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","title":"Tracker"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"type":"topic","title":"Trackers","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","abstract":[],"role":"collection"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":